{
  "uid": "ticket-reservas",
  "title": "Reservas e mensageria",
  "description": "As metricas do dominio, e nao da infraestrutura. Sao as que respondem a pergunta que originou o projeto: quanta disputa realmente chega ao estoque, e o que acontece quando as defesas em volta dela falham.",
  "tags": [
    "ticket-platform",
    "dominio"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Lugares vendidos (1h)",
      "description": "O numero que diz se a plataforma esta cumprindo a funcao dela. Todos os indicadores tecnicos podem estar verdes e este ficar em zero.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(booking_lugares_vendidos_total[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Lugares vendidos (1h)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Reservas expiradas (1h)",
      "description": "Desistencia por inercia: reservou e sumiu. Disparando, o prazo de pagamento provavelmente esta curto demais.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(booking_reservas_expiradas_total[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Reservas expiradas (1h)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "orange"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Reservas canceladas (1h)",
      "description": "Desistencia deliberada. Separada da expiracao de proposito: somadas, escondem a diferenca que diria qual dos dois problemas existe.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(booking_reservas_canceladas_total[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Reservas canceladas (1h)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "yellow"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tempo mediano ate pagar",
      "description": "Da criacao da reserva ao pagamento — quanto o usuario demora para decidir. Quanto a cobranca demora ja aparece na latencia do payment-simulator.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum(rate(booking_tempo_ate_confirmacao_seconds_bucket[1h])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "Tempo mediano ate pagar"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 1,
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Locks adquiridos (1h)",
      "description": "Reservas que entraram na secao critica com exclusividade.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(booking_lock_adquiridos_total[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "adquiridos"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Locks nao adquiridos (1h)",
      "description": "Tentativas que desistiram do lock depois das repeticoes configuradas. Nao e erro: e a medida de quanta gente disputou o mesmo evento ao mesmo tempo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(booking_lock_nao_adquiridos_total[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "nao adquiridos"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "orange"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Reservas sem lock nenhum (1h)",
      "description": "Quantas vezes o Redis nao respondeu e a reserva seguiu adiante mesmo assim. E o painel que mostra a tese do projeto funcionando: o lock e uma otimizacao para reduzir disputa, nao a garantia. Mesmo com este numero alto, o UPDATE condicional e a constraint no PostgreSQL continuam impedindo a venda a mais.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(booking_lock_degradacoes_total[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "degradacoes"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Locks expirados em uso (1h)",
      "description": "O TTL venceu enquanto a secao critica ainda rodava, o que significa que duas threads podem ter estado la dentro juntas. Continua sem oversell — e o banco que garante — mas um numero diferente de zero aqui pede um TTL maior.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(booking_lock_expirados_total[1h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "expirados"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disputa pelo lock de reserva",
      "description": "As duas curvas juntas contam o formato da carga. Um pico simultaneo no mesmo evento — o cenario que o projeto existe para resolver — aparece como as duas subindo ao mesmo tempo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(booking_lock_adquiridos_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "adquiridos"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(booking_lock_nao_adquiridos_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "nao adquiridos"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(booking_lock_degradacoes_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "sem lock (Redis fora)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "adquiridos"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "sem lock (Redis fora)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Outbox transacional",
      "description": "As 'descartadas' sao mensagens que esgotaram as tentativas e sairam do caminho para nao travar o lote. Cada uma e uma notificacao que ninguem recebeu — o unico numero deste painel que merece investigacao imediata.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(booking_outbox_publicadas_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "publicadas"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(booking_outbox_falhas_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "falhas (serao repetidas)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(booking_outbox_descartadas_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "descartadas (perdidas)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "publicadas"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "descartadas (perdidas)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Notificacoes e deduplicacao",
      "description": "O RabbitMQ entrega ao menos uma vez, entao a mesma confirmacao pode chegar duas vezes ao notification-service. As 'duplicatas descartadas' sao a prova de que a defesa contra isso esta trabalhando; se elas existem e as 'enviadas' nao dobraram, ninguem recebeu o e-mail em dobro.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(notification_enviadas_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "enviadas"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(notification_duplicatas_descartadas_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "duplicatas descartadas"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(notification_deduplicacao_degradacoes_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "sem deduplicacao (Redis fora)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "enviadas"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "sem deduplicacao (Redis fora)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Vendidos contra devolvidos ao pool",
      "description": "O que entra e o que volta. Lugares liberados vem com o motivo como etiqueta, entao a mesma serie responde 'quanto voltou' e 'por que voltou'.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(booking_lugares_vendidos_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "vendidos"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (motivo) (rate(booking_lugares_liberados_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "liberados — {{motivo}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
